onments, and clearer tutorial guidance. We’ve also rewritten the Tablet’s Tutorial content, improved menus and controller navigation, and addressed several issues involving crates, customers, and machine placement.All changes below are available in the latest demo.Main Updates","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-23T13:08:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114036332","verified_at":"2026-10-23T15:35:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5044940-1846651706681176","game_id":"steam-5044940","kind":"announcement","title":"Aqua Factory Simulator Joins Steam Next Fest: Bring Your Crew!","summary":"Hi everyone, 😄We’re bringing aquatic farming, factory automation, and co-op to Steam Next Fest: October 2026!Aqua Factory Simulator will participate from October 19 to October 26, 2026. Whether you’re planning to build your business solo or share the work with friends, we’d love to welcome you to the coast.And you don’t have to wait for the festival. The free demo is available to play now!From Sea to Shelf, TogetherStart your own aquatic business and connect the journey from growing and harvesti","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-16T11:56:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706681176","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:02:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5044940-1846651706681163","game_id":"steam-5044940","kind":"announcement","title":"Aqua Factory Simulator - Raise Fish, Build Factory, and Manage Store Together","summary":"Hi everyone, 😄Welcome to our first Aqua Factory Simulator devlog! Thank you to everyone who has tried the demo over the past few days. We’re excited to introduce the game and share a look at what you can build along the coast.Aqua Facto